    <string name="faq_title">Frequently Asked Questions</string>
    <string name="collapse">Collapse</string>
    <string name="expand">Expand</string>
    <string name="faq_q1">How do I book a consultation?</string>
    <string name="faq_a1">Go to the Dashboard and tap "Book Consultation". Select your preferred doctor, date, and time slot to complete your booking.</string>
    <string name="faq_q2">How can I view my health records?</string>
    <string name="faq_a2">Navigate to "Health Records" from the Dashboard. All your uploaded documents, prescriptions, and reports will be available there.</string>
    <string name="faq_q3">What is the QR code feature?</string>
    <string name="faq_a3">The QR code allows healthcare providers to quickly access your medical information during emergencies. You can find it on the Dashboard.</string>
    <string name="faq_q4">How do I set medication reminders?</string>
    <string name="faq_a4">Tap the "Reminder" tab in the bottom navigation to create and manage your medication reminders.</string>
    <string name="faq_q5">Can I change my profile information?</string>
    <string name="faq_a5">Yes. Go to Settings and then Edit Profile to update your personal information, contact details, and emergency contacts.</string>
    <string name="faq_q6">How do I reset my password?</string>
    <string name="faq_a6">Go to Settings and then Change Password. You will need to enter your current password and then set a new one.</string>
    <string name="faq_q7">Is my health data secure?</string>
    <string name="faq_a7">Yes, all your data is encrypted and stored securely. We follow strict healthcare data protection standards. Read our Privacy Policy for more details.</string>
    <string name="faq_q8">How do I cancel a consultation?</string>
    <string name="faq_a8">Go to your consultation history, select the appointment you want to cancel, and tap "Cancel Appointment". Cancellation policies may apply.</string>
    <string name="faq_q9">Can I upload my own medical documents?</string>
    <string name="faq_a9">Yes, you can upload medical documents through the Health Records section. Supported formats include PDF, JPG, and PNG.</string>
    <string name="faq_q10">What payment methods are accepted?</string>
    <string name="faq_a10">We accept major debit cards, credit cards, mobile wallets, and online banking for consultation payments.</string>

